@prefix iep: <https://example.org/iep-ontology/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
iep: a owl:Ontology .
iep:Entity a owl:Class .
iep:Agent a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Entity .
iep:Person a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Agent .
iep:Organization a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Agent .
iep:InformationArtifact a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Entity .
iep:Plan a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:InformationArtifact .
iep:Assertion a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:InformationArtifact .
iep:Evidence a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:InformationArtifact .
iep:Activity a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Entity .
iep:Observation a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Activity .
iep:Decision a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Activity .
iep:TimeInterval a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Entity .
iep:Location a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Entity .
iep:Student a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Person .
iep:Stakeholder a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Person .
iep:Course a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Activity .
iep:IEP a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Plan .
iep:Goal a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Plan .
iep:Service a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Activity .
iep:Accommodation a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Plan .
iep:Assessment a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Observation .
iep:CourseReport a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Evidence .
iep:SourceDocument a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Evidence .
iep:Placement a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Assertion .
iep:Eligibility a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Assertion .
iep:ReviewDecision a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:Decision .
iep:Template a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:InformationArtifact .
iep:FieldBinding a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf iep:InformationArtifact .
iep:subject a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:domain iep:InformationArtifact; rdfs:range iep:Entity .
iep:partOf a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:domain iep:Entity; rdfs:range iep:Entity .
iep:supportedBy a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:domain iep:Assertion; rdfs:range iep:Evidence .
iep:performedBy a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:domain iep:Activity; rdfs:range iep:Agent .
iep:occursDuring a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:domain iep:Activity; rdfs:range iep:TimeInterval .
iep:occursAt a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:domain iep:Activity; rdfs:range iep:Location .
iep:usesTemplate a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:domain iep:IEP; rdfs:range iep:Template .
